<title>USA: Vitech America receives $7.5 mln order.</title>
<headline>Vitech America receives $7.5 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitech America Inc said Tuesday it has received additional product orders amounting to $7.5 million from a retail chain in Brazil.</p>
<p>The new orders, which are to be shipped during the first half of 1997, were made by Casas Bahia, a consumer electronics retail chain based in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>Vitech assembles and sells its own brand name of personal computers, business systems integration and network equipment.</p>
